  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lady Cold Ash names her a rank eight Gu Immortal of Eastern Sea’s black heaven and sends An Chong to meet her as Soul Pacifying grotto-heaven’s envoy. An Chong enters Shattered Bone grotto-heaven and finds her ready to unite human grotto-heavens. She agrees at once, warns that variant human forces dominate Eastern Sea’s black heaven, and asks him to help persuade Old Immortal Hua Yu of Profound Literature grotto-heaven in white heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1975
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_cold_ash",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_an_chong",
        "loc_soul_pacifying_grotto_heaven",
        "loc_skeleton_grotto_heaven",
        "char_old_immortal_hua_yu",
        "loc_profound_literature_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling tells Qi Sea Ancestor that Heavenly Court captured Granny Skeleton, the current owner of Shattered Bone grotto-heaven in the two heavens. An Chong’s words had persuaded her to join the two heavens alliance, but she was ambushed halfway. Heavenly Court releases her after persuasion. The qi harvest fruit also appears in Shattered Bone grotto-heaven, which Qin Ding Ling treats as the key to recruiting her and other human forces.",
      "chapters": [
        2005
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-and-qi-sea",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She enters Qi Sea Ancestor’s hall, bows, and states that Skeleton grotto-heaven is willing to come under him. He accepts her and notes that Skeleton grotto-heaven is nearest to Crescent Moon grotto-heaven, which has fallen to Wu Shuai’s side, and asks to station troops there. She lowers her head under outside pressure, observing that almost no unaffiliated grotto-heavens remain in the immemorial two heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        2018
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "skeleton-grotto-heaven-joins",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crescent_moon_grotto_heaven",
        "char_wu_shuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the ant plague hits the Righteous Qi Alliance, the grotto-heavens of the two heavens are the main victims. Granny Skeleton is named among the main targets together with Old Immortal Hua Yu and Fire Plain grotto-heaven’s owner.",
      "chapters": [
        2103
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ant-plague-target",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_righteous_qi_alliance",
        "loc_fire_plain_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a member of the Righteous Qi Alliance with Old Immortal Hua Yu and other two-heavens human forces, vaguely ostracized by Eastern Sea’s super forces because their foundation is in the two heavens. After Qi Sea Ancestor’s identity is exposed, she and Hua Yu are stunned that they had been seeking Fang Yuan’s favor.",
      "chapters": [
        2220
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unwitting-pursuit-of-fang-yuans-favor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is gathered with other grotto lords under Heavenly Court after relocation, arranged as a formation core above Central Continent. As one of the first batch from immemorial black heaven, she is forced by circumstances to join Heavenly Court and feels regret once variant human grotto-heavens in black heaven are left untouched.",
      "chapters": [
        2275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    }
  ],
